36	## Gotchas + fixes
37	1. **supabase-js 2.118 on Node 20 throws `Node.js detected but native WebSocket not found`** at createClient (node scripts, vitest). Fix: `.npmrc` with `node-options=--experimental-websocket` (applies to npm run / npx), or `node --experimental-websocket script.mjs`. The Next server (dev/start) worked without it.
