42	6. `prisma db pull` with default (public only): P4002 cross-schema reference to auth.users → `schemas = ["auth","public"]` (pulls ~27 auth models + enums; fine). Models get `@@schema("public")`.
43	7. First `supabase db reset` right after start failed `DbSetupError: error running container: exit 1`; rerun succeeded.
44	8. vitest.config: `import { loadEnvConfig } from "@next/env"` fails in .mts (CJS) → `import nextEnv from "@next/env"; nextEnv.loadEnvConfig(process.cwd())`. Use `vitest.config.mts` (a .ts config warns about ESM-as-CJS).
45	9. Top-level await in a tsx script: name it `.mts` (`npx --yes tsx scripts/prisma-check.mts`).
46	10. create-next-app 16 sets `cacheComponents: true` in next.config.ts; /api/me with cookies() still built as dynamic (ƒ) — no change needed. AGENTS.md says read node_modules/next/dist/docs/.
47	11. ESLint: Next 16 flat config (`eslint.config.mjs`, defineConfig + globalIgnores) passed `--max-warnings=0` unchanged; added `"src/generated/**"` to globalIgnores (not strictly needed).
48	12. create-next-app `.gitignore` has `.env*` (would ignore .env.example) → replace with `.env`, `.env.local`, `.env*.local`, `!.env.example`; check `git ls-files .env.example`.
