50	14. Kit says `vitest.config.ts`: a `.ts` config works but prints an ESM-as-CJS warning; `.mts` is clean (needs the default-import fix in 8).
51	15. Don't `pkill -f 'next start'` from a shell whose command line contains that string — kills itself. Kill by pid from `ss -ltnp | grep :3000`.
